# scenario: resume-incompatible
# doc: resume-incompatible.md
# given: invoked as `claudine compose --claude resume-incompatible.md` from the directory holding the fixture documents
# given: launch 1 reports session session-1 and exits 1 with no result
# given: failure rewrites the document's model on disk, then returns resume
# given: the refreshed launch identity changes the model facet, so the resume is refused as session-incompatible after start re-fires; no second launch
event initialize
event start
work fresh 1
event failure
err provider.exited
event start
event failure
err composition.failed
event finalize
err composition.failed
exit 1
